      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that when every step feels like a futile burden, the quiet stillness of non-existence seems like the only logical escape, yet true peace often begins by acknowledging these depths without needing to change them immediately. Please know that while it is your right to feel this heaviness, there are people who can walk with you through this fog before it completely erases your existence. Would you be willing to just pause for a moment before deciding that the way out is truly impossible?",
